kikigaki bundled license texts
===============================

This directory ships upstream license texts inside the app bundle
(Contents/Resources/licenses/), alongside NOTICE at Contents/Resources/NOTICE.
See ../NOTICE for the full attribution list and the static-library inventory.

Files here:

- sherpa-onnx.LICENSE  — Apache License 2.0 (k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx)
- onnxruntime.LICENSE  — MIT License (microsoft/onnxruntime)
- silero-vad.LICENSE   — MIT License (snakers4/silero-vad)
- hayamimi.LICENSE     — MIT License (oboroge0/hayamimi)

Apache-2.0 model coverage
--------------------------

ReazonSpeech (the zipformer ASR model) and mojicast-punct-onnx (the punctuation
model) are both distributed under the Apache License 2.0, but neither upstream
project ships its own copy of the license text in a redistributable location.
They are covered by the Apache-2.0 text in sherpa-onnx.LICENSE — the same
license, verbatim — plus the attribution lines for each in NOTICE. No separate
license file is duplicated here for them.
